  "description": {
    "text": "Pokémon Festa 2004 was held at 12 venues across Japan from 17 July to 15 August 2004 and hosted the Battle Road Summer 2004 tournaments. Its visitors got Deoxys 019/PCG-P, for that summer's film Destiny Deoxys, which Pokémon Center stores gave out too. Pokémon Daisuki Club members who took part in the club's stage event got the Poké Dude Supporter, a photograph of the host of Oshie TV, and, Pokumon adds, LaRousse's Munchlax 025/PCG-P, the card of Pokémon Center Tokyo's reopening that August.",
